  skos:prefLabel "World War I, Interwar Period, World War II, Cold War Conflicts, Revolution, Decolonization, and" ;
  mi:categoryDescription "Democratization, and Case Studies of Genocide Assess the interregional causes and consequences of the global wars, revolutions, and independence movements during this era." ;
